Z||000012||malacite||12-30-2001||10:30 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DaRkLoRD:<BR><B>strip it for parts first, flyback transformers are always fun to play with, as are large capacitors..<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>be careful with those caps there. television caps have a tendency to hold a charge for a long time, and can really hurt.<P>if you can get the caps up, cut an extension cord and splice the wires into it. then go fourty feet away and plug it in.<P>hee hee...boom<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Malacite<P>Grendel-88 Fiero RIP<BR>'94 Saturn SW2 RallySport<BR>'95 Saturn SL1 Touring||||reg||1
